{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "arma-correctional-group-recruitment-notice",
  "name": "Arma Correctional Group Recruitment Notice",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Arma_Correctional_Group_Recruitment_Notice",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-15T09:07:35.239Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Will you end your lives here in prison, fettered like dogs?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "No!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Even fallen into the depths of jail, your lives are still full of infinite possibilities!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Join the Arma Correctional Group and join me to help the myriad convicts!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6322a42c1b24bb94"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Become one of us, and we promise you:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You will be the first to enjoy the Group's latest breakthroughs in research! Can imprisonment really be this entertaining, you say?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Become a hero amongst your cellmates! Who will be able to get the best stuff?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Own the chance to atone for your crimes with Arma! Freedom is within your reach!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-84979528c8b8525c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This position requires:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Proficiency in basic product research and user profile development."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The ability to investigate, evaluate, and sift through partnership opportunities with various industry brands."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A willingness to actively communicate with material suppliers to optimize our product and technology."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The ability to push for progress and bring partnership product designs and marketing proposals to reality."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3856a8eb038e50a0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We hope that you:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Have implanted Synesthesia Beacon or higher education, or were convicted of deception and fraud."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(Bonus points to those who were convicted of beguilement!)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Have three or more years of work experience, and were the mastermind of at least three or more criminal activities."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(No violent crimes please! We're a peaceful organization!)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Both your sentence and life expectancy have to be at least two hundred or more years."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(We hope you'll work long-term with us!)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Death row convicts need not apply."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(This is very important!)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-aa69f6d0d68887a0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Arma Correctional Group eagerly awaits your participation!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-91b9f832890e57d6"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
